@startuml UC53B_CountUnread
!theme plain
title UC53B: Đếm tin nhắn chưa đọc

actor User as "Customer/Staff/Admin"
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB

User -> Frontend: Truy cập trang chat / dashboard
Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/chat/unread-count\n(Authorization: Bearer token)

API -> API: Verify JWT token
API -> DB: Query conversations\n(filter: participants chứa userId)\n(aggregate: sum unreadCount[userId])

DB --> API: Total unread count

API --> Frontend: Success + { totalUnread: number }
Frontend --> User: Hiển thị badge unread\n(trên icon chat, navigation bar)

' ========== Real-time update ==========
note right
  Khi có tin nhắn mới:
  - Socket.IO emit "new-message"
  - Frontend tự động gọi lại API
  - Hoặc Socket.IO emit "unread-count-updated"
end note
@enduml

